Copyright 2024-2026 ACTA

This product includes software developed by ACTA (https://acta.build).

This directory contains ACTA Soroban smart contracts derived from
https://github.com/ACTA-Team/contracts-acta (branch dev, commit 282fe47) and
modified for ACTA Gate, together with the normative `did:stellar` specification:

  - vc-vault              — single-tenant Verifiable Credential vault
  - vc-vault-factory      — vault deployer and fee configuration
  - did-stellar-registry  — on-chain registry for the did:stellar method
  - ../docs/did-spec      — did:stellar v0.1 specification and test vectors

The reference implementation of the `did:stellar` method (TypeScript SDK and
HTTP resolver) lives in https://github.com/ACTA-Team/did-stellar and is
likewise licensed under the Apache License, Version 2.0.

